#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:1
#: f93bef698bb74be8ad62f5eda8c7232d
msgid "按晶格参数选择（Select by Lattice）"
msgstr "Select by Lattice Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:3
#: a5be0b541ae840a39c4d8adbc2bd00af
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:5
#: dd7622f780dd4dcd93056847247ac921
msgid "按照晶格长度 `a/b/c` 和晶格角 `α/β/γ` 选择结构。适合从混合数据中找特定尺寸、 体形或畸变范围的晶胞，不依赖当前散点图坐标。"
msgstr "Select structures by lattice lengths `a/b/c` and angles `α/β/γ`. Use it to find cells with a particular size, shape, or distortion range in mixed data; the selection does not depend on the current scatter-plot axes."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:8
#: 387ccf424c3941038a83b27dbb369b23
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:10
#: 1d4bb67bd5bb4e6b91b422661b37a7dc
msgid "对每个结构，程序从晶胞矩阵计算"
msgstr "For each structure, the program computes the following values from the cell matrix:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:12
#: 3b8b3968de9c43018e018aee3d880ab2
msgid ""
"\n"
"(a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"(a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma),\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:16
#: 5a3c8847671841808d78158d46c7662f
msgid ""
"其中 $a,b,c$ 是三条晶格矢量长度，单位为 Å；$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ 分别是 $\\mathbf b$ 与 "
"$\\mathbf c$、$\\mathbf a$ 与 $\\mathbf c$、$\\mathbf a$ 与 $\\mathbf b$ "
"的夹角，单位为度。结构只有在六个量都落入各自闭区间时才会被选中："
msgstr "Here $a,b,c$ are the three lattice-vector lengths in Å. $\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ are respectively the angles between $\\mathbf b$ and $\\mathbf c$, $\\mathbf a$ and $\\mathbf c$, and $\\mathbf a$ and $\\mathbf b$, in degrees. A structure is selected only when all six quantities lie in their respective closed intervals:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:20
#: 581e8df4b5694a41a7a23bb27b17ac8a
msgid ""
"\n"
"M(i)=\\bigwedge_{q\\in\\{a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\}}\n"
"\\left(q_{\\min}-10^{-4}\\le q_i\\le q_{\\max}+10^{-4}\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"M(i)=\\bigwedge_{q\\in\\{a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\}}\n"
"\\left(q_{\\min}-10^{-4}\\le q_i\\le q_{\\max}+10^{-4}\\right).\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:25
#: 11c0eba0c558422890cd8905dcb1be4a
#, python-brace-format
msgid "固定的 $10^{-4}$ 容差用于吸收浮点换算误差，并不是可调的物理容差。若某一维不想参与筛选， 应把该维范围放宽到覆盖全部数据。"
msgstr "The fixed $10^{-4}$ tolerance only absorbs floating-point conversion error; it is not an adjustable physical tolerance. To exclude one dimension from filtering, widen its range to cover all data."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:28
#: 9b033ecd3632491da02c43d22c1b8fd9
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5920
#: 58a71f11c79e498d84a7e9a55ea01745
msgid "输入控件：晶格长度 `a / b / c` 与晶格角 `α / β / γ` 各自的最小值和最大值。"
msgstr "Controls: minimum and maximum values for lattice lengths `a / b / c` and angles `α / β / γ`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5921
#: 312042d680384e9e8f31d51800ac0b2c
msgid "范围：`[0, 1e6]`，4 位小数。"
msgstr "Range: `[0, 1e6]`, with four decimal places."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5922
#: cda2e1d58af5493f951512ca3d385df8
msgid "默认值：当前活动结构的晶格参数范围。"
msgstr "Defaults: the lattice-parameter ranges of the currently active structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5923
#: 12665985583d4c97b1719387a5793e6a
msgid "细节：内部比较带固定容差 `1e-4`。"
msgstr "Detail: internal comparisons use a fixed `1e-4` tolerance."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5925
