#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:35
#: 6a451551901d438788c335d9b5654e4e
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:37
#: a08bc32553214c8eb6243623f2732af8
msgid "六组范围同时生效。若没有选中结果，先放宽不关心的晶格角或长度范围，再逐项收紧， 避免把无关维度设成过窄的过滤条件。"
msgstr "All six ranges apply simultaneously. If nothing is selected, first widen the length or angle ranges that are not relevant, then tighten the intended dimensions one at a time."
